	(text "Cell and reverse protection" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "64ba62b0-16c8-5544-8670-c24b24a8f3b1"))
	(text "Q1 conducts through its body diode at insertion,\nthen Vgs = -VBAT turns it fully on.\nReversed cell: Vgs ~ 0, Q1 stays off." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 111.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2d22187d-6d64-5cad-82e9-e5fe71e9b380"))
	(text "LCD boost (TPS61099, SLVSD88M)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 99.06 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0eaeea16-f7d7-5ffa-b075-995f9f5605c3"))
	(text "VOUT = VREF x (1 + R1/R2) = 1.00 V x (1 + 402k/200k) = 3.01 V\n(PWM; in PFM VREF is 1.03 V typ -> ~3.10 V)\nR2 <= 200k keeps divider current >= 100x FB leakage (50 nA max).\nL = 1 uH (datasheet: 1 uH for VOUT <= 3.0 V).\nCOUT >= 20 uF nominal -> 2 x 10 uF.\nEN low = true disconnect; R3 holds EN low while the MCU pin is Hi-Z." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 99.06 111.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2b61a5d6-a895-5129-838e-ec7f74b980d6"))
